      en: ["The project was completed in 1967 at a cost of approximately $1.5 billion.", "The dam is named after the village of Mangla, located at the mouth of the reservoir.", "The main dam structure is 3,140 meters long and over 140 meters high.", "Mangla Hydel Power Station features 10 power generation units.", "The reservoir covers a surface area of approximately 250 square kilometers.", "The 2009 dam raising project increased storage capacity by 2.9 million acre-feet."],
